  "description": "MAVTEL crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C138 H174 La8 N40 O12,4(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, La2 (La) has 4 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 3 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 2 O neighbors; La1 (La) has 2 O neighbors; La5 (La) has 4 O neighbors; La6 (La) has 3 O neighbors; La7 (La) has 2 O neighbors; La8 (La) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.882-4.089 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.75-113.98°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C138H174La8N40O12,4(C7H8).",
